  ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │ Named URLs carry a port                                                            │
  │ Jobs publishing a url answer on http://<job>.<worktree>.<repo>.localhost:11080     │
  │ `wtm run proxy install` serves them on port 80 so the port disappears from the URL │
